      "text": "USCIS, with @ICEgov and @FBI, conducted Operation Twin Shield, targeting immigration fraud in the Minneapolis-St. Paul area Sept. 19-28.\nOur officers focused on 1,000+ cases that had fraud or ineligibility indicators, conducted site visits & in-person interviews, finding evidence of suspected fraud or compliance issues in 275 cases.\nRead: https://t.co/HhP3kCFxFa",
